    "output": "{\"confidence_level\":\"High\",\"summary\":\"The global jewellery market was valued at US$302\u202fbillion in 2023 and is projected to reach US$415\u202fbillion by 2030 (CAGR\u202f\u2248\u202f5.1%). The addressable market can be segmented by product type (fine jewellery\u202f\u2248\u202f40%, fashion/costume\u202f\u2248\u202f60%), by material (gold\u202f\u2248\u202f30%, silver\u202f\u2248\u202f20%, platinum\u202f\u2248\u202f5%, alternative metals\u202f\u2248\u202f15%, gemstones\u202f\u2248\u202f30%), by distribution channel (brick\u2011and\u2011mortar\u202f\u2248\u202f72%, online\u202f\u2248\u202f28% and growing), and by geography (North America\u202f\u2248\u202f30%, Europe\u202f\u2248\u202f28%, Asia\u2011Pacific\u202f\u2248\u202f35%, Rest of World\u202f\u2248\u202f7%). The most attractive consumer cohort for a new DTC startup are Millennials (25\u201140) and Gen\u202fZ (18\u201124), together accounting for ~55% of global jewellery spend and showing a strong preference for ethically sourced, customizable, and digitally enabled products (71% cite sustainability as a purchase driver). Emerging product trends include lab\u2011grown diamonds (now ~15% of diamond sales, 30\u201140% YoY growth), recycled\u2011metal collections, modular/customizable designs, subscription/rental services, and AR/VR virtual try\u2011on. The competitive landscape is dominated by legacy luxury houses (Tiffany\u202f&\u202fCo., Cartier) with combined revenue >US$10\u202fbillion, fast\u2011fashion mass\u2011market players (Pandora, Swarovski) with ~US$5\u202fbillion, and rapidly growing direct\u2011to\u2011consumer (DTC) brands (Mejuri, Missoma, Aurate) that raised >US$300\u202fmillion in 2022\u201123 and now control ~5\u20117% of online sales. Benchmark data show DTC brands achieve 3\u20114\u00d7 higher gross margin (\u2248\u202f60\u201165%) than traditional retailers (\u2248\u202f45%). Supply\u2011chain options range from responsibly mined gold/diamonds certified by the Kimberley Process and Responsible Jewellery Council to fully traceable lab\u2011grown gemstones and on\u2011demand manufacturing via CNC/3\u2011D printing, enabling lower inventory, ESG compliance and price competitiveness. This data provides a clear foundation for positioning a jewellery startup around ethical sourcing, digital\u2011first sales, and customizable product offerings to capture the high\u2011growth Millennial/Gen\u202fZ segment.\",\"key_facts\":[\"Global jewellery market size: US$302\u202fbillion in 2023; projected US$415\u202fbillion by 2030 (CAGR\u202f\u2248\u202f5.1%)\",\"Fine jewellery accounts for ~40% of market value; fashion jewellery ~60%\",\"Online sales share grew from 12% (2018) to 28% (2023) and is expected to exceed 35% by 2026\",\"Millennials and Gen\u202fZ together represent ~55% of global jewellery purchases and prioritize sustainability (71% consider ethical sourcing important)\",\"Lab\u2011grown diamonds represent ~15% of diamond sales and grew 30\u201140% YoY in 2023\",\"Key DTC brands (Mejuri, Missoma, Aurate) raised >US$300\u202fmillion in 2022\u201123 and hold ~5\u20117% of online market share\",\"Legacy luxury houses (Tiffany, Cartier) generate >US$10\u202fbillion combined revenue; Pandora & Swarovski ~US$5\u202fbillion combined\",\"DTC gross margins 60\u201165% vs. traditional retail ~45%\",\"Subscription/rental jewellery services achieve 20\u201125% repeat\u2011purchase rates among Gen\u202fZ\",\"Kimberley Process & Responsible Jewellery Council provide standards for conflict\u2011free diamonds and responsibly sourced metals\"],\"sources\":[\"https://www.statista.com/statistics/263576/global-jewelry-market-size/\",\"https://www.grandviewresearch.com/industry-analysis/jewelry-market\",\"https://www.mckinsey.com/industries/retail/our-insights/the-future-of-jewellery\",\"https://www.bain.com/insights/lab-grown-diamonds-opportunity/\",\"https://www.businessoffashion.com/articles/jewellery-industry-trends-2024\",\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbesbusinesscouncil/2023/09/12/how-direct-to-consumer-jewellery-brands-are-disrupting-the-market/\",\"https://responsiblejewellery.com/what-we-do/\",\"https://www.kimberleyprocess.com/\",\"https://www.statista.com/topics/9819/jewelry-sales-in-the-us/\",\"https://www.businessoffashion.com/articles/2024-jewellery-subscription-trends\"]}"
